- WB | invest the fortune carefully so it lasts a hundred years | v: security | sphere: faith.WB | chance: 55
- WU | draw up clear rules for who may ask for help, and how | v: conformity, universalism | sphere: faith.WU | chance: 55
works: The gift does good for years, and {N} can see the difference on the street.
